      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            { "name": "Lace weight yarn (white)", "qty": "60 m" },
            { "name": "3.5 mm crochet hook", "qty": "1" },
            { "name": "Tapestry needle", "qty": "1" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Centre ring" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Magic ring. Chain 3, work 11 tr into ring (12 tr). Join. Round 2: ch 5, *skip 1, tr in next tr, ch 3; repeat from * around (6 ch-3 spaces)." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Arms and branches" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "For each arm: chain 14, then at the 5th chain, work a branch: chain 5, sl st back to the 5th chain. Continue along the arm to the 10th chain and work a second branch (ch 5, sl st back). Slip stitch to the arm tip, picot, then sl st back to the centre ring. Work 5 more arms in the same way." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Outer ring and finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Work a connecting chain between each arm tip. Picot at each connection. Fasten off and weave in the end. Block by pinning each tip outward." }]
      }
    ]
  }
